<title>NORWAY: Braathens Q1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Braathens Q1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				(millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue		    1,175    vs	 976</p>
<p> Operating result			  46    vs	  42</p>
<p> Result before extraordinary items   52    vs	  28</p>
<p> Net profit				  39    vs	  20</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian airliner is Braathens SAFE. --Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
